      "shadowClaw and boneRush are Black, which adds the SKILL layer on top.",
      "Attackers: Shadow Stalker Black/Black/Black, Imp Red, Golem non-elemental.",
      "Targets: Archangel White/White, Ooze Green, Wisp Blue."
