  {
    "id": "growth",
    "name": "Levelled creatures -- seeded growth is visible to G2",
    "seed": 20260726,
    "level": 14,
    "_note": [
      "Every other fixture builds its battlers at level 1 (cli_tools passes",
      "`fixture.level or 1`), so the entire growth model -- the largest single",
      "determinant of every stat in the game -- was invisible to G2. Rewriting",
      "growth from a smooth species curve to seeded per-instance packets moved",
      "zero golden lines, which proved coverage rather than correctness.",
      "This fixture fights at level 14: mid-band for the 11-20 budgets, so both",
      "the first band's full total and a partial second band are exercised.",
      "Both sides are levelled, so a change to accumulation shows up in damage",
      "dealt AND taken."
